---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import icon from '../assets/icon-nobg-hq.png';
---

<Layout title="CrossCraft" pageTitle="HOME" activeNav="home">
  <div class="video-embed">
    <iframe
      src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/qyBIBr1kWlI"
      title="YouTube video player"
      frameborder="0"
      allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
      allowfullscreen></iframe>
  </div>

  <p>
    <b>CrossCraft</b> is an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Minecraft Classic 0.30.
  </p>

  <hr />

  <h3>New in v1.1</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Three new platforms</b> — Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo Switch, and WASM/WebGL in the browser</li>
    <li><b>ClassicWorld saves</b> — compatible with ClassiCube; existing worlds upgrade automatically</li>
    <li><b>Rebuilt input</b> — configurable controls on PC, PSP, and 3DS, plus middle-click block picking</li>
    <li><b>Rebuilt UI</b> — proper sliders and buttons, chat text wrapping</li>
    <li><b>Save management</b> — multi-save browser, world creation menu, multiplayer world dumps</li>
    <li><b>Faster everywhere</b> — asynchronous world saves and quicker chunk meshing</li>
    <li><b>macOS audio</b> — enabled at last</li>
  </ul>

  <Image slot="sidebar" src={icon} alt="CrossCraft icon" loading="eager" />
  <ul slot="sidebar" style="list-style-type: none;">
    <li>Faithful, Version by Version</li>
    <li>PC, PSP, 3DS, Switch &amp; Web</li>
    <li>Powered by Zig and Aether</li>
  </ul>
  <div slot="sidebar">
    <p class="version-label">CrossCraft Classic v1.1.1</p>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/CrossCraft/CrossCraft/releases/tag/classic-client%2Fv1.1.1"
      class="mc-button mc-green button"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener">Download Client</a
    >
    <p class="version-label">Classic Server v1.1</p>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/CrossCraft/CrossCraft/releases/tag/classic-server%2Fv1.1.0"
      class="mc-button mc-green button"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener">Download Server</a
    >
  </div>
</Layout>
